{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>DISCOPUP</strong>, you're a seal eager to party, making your way to the most famous nightclub in the city: <i>DiscoPup</i>. However, tonight, the bouncer is only letting dogs in. How will you make it past him?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380950/extras/e0dd4d732cfa6af5423d20d608b860af.poster.avif?t=1768581881\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380950/extras/e0dd4d732cfa6af5423d20d608b860af.webm?t=1768581881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380950/extras/e0dd4d732cfa6af5423d20d608b860af.mp4?t=1768581881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Costumes!\u00a0</strong>Find the right accesories and combine them in such a way that will make you look just like any other party dog. Put your fashion sense to the test against DiscoPup's bouncer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380950/extras/51c87cda2502bd20b85508ef70881e6f.poster.avif?t=1768581881\" width=606 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380950/extras/51c87cda2502bd20b85508ef70881e6f.webm?t=1768581881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380950/extras/51c87cda2502bd20b85508ef70881e6f.mp4?t=1768581881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet quirky characters!</strong>\u00a0A mouse that speaks in tiny words. A suspicious wolf granny. A cowboy puppy with a big plastic on his paw. A mind-reading ferret. They all have something to say and they might help you in your search for the perfect dog costume.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380950/extras/63c357ddee8a65b7abc3d790385802f5.poster.avif?t=1768581881\" width=606 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380950/extras/63c357ddee8a65b7abc3d790385802f5.webm?t=1768581881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380950/extras/63c357ddee8a65b7abc3d790385802f5.mp4?t=1768581881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you only have so much <i>time...</i> DiscoPup closes its doors at 2:00 a.m. Whatever you do, make sure it brings you closer to your goal. Investigate and figure out which actions are worth your time. The best night of your life depends on it.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Banger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3380950/ce5e215fd725a2dd5b838e7ddb198c226f5d941f.jpg"},{"name":"Ending A","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3380950/8f35e10243c333b049ccc64e9231f8142cda9aea.jpg"},{"name":"Ending B","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3380950/1b5170348ab4e8ba8885296daddb6ecc51c9b401.jpg"},{"name":"Ending C","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3380950/13e319e027bda9bc02ac93d7b740448af03a7118.jpg"},{"name":"Ending D","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3380950/ad613484a9060c518c28daebff6ae1acc987c04c.jpg"},{"name":"Bronze Horse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3380950/b089ae6ab460759491ee34095f5512bf814df75a.jpg"},{"name":"Happy Mask Sealsman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3380950/9bf58a4ee2a3074f616c5f88d6ee1e8957ce57b7.jpg"},{"name":"Ending Z","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3380950/95800e315db07d7c8d58143dfa82590b61d45f61.jpg"},{"name":"Bunny Chase","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3380950/b8dc957552a548d623d3858951f68344b4ab5840.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Disguise","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3380950/e9108503e7599941d17f4822ff92a1cadff0d1a5.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3380950?t=1768581881","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380950/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768581881","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380950/d087a752044becc68935cfb0d2b00b2336ba1a4f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768581881","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380950/d087a752044becc68935cfb0d2b00b2336ba1a4f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768581881","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3768160,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"